Subject: [PATCH 10/31] refactor: move every environment variable to the
 HESTIA_ prefix

- Hard cutover: env.ts reads only HESTIA_* names; the old names are ignored or rejected
- Compose, the E2E overlay, Caddy, scripts, workflows, tests, docs and .env.example follow
- VITE_* build-time names are unchanged
- Add env tests for the cutover: legacy-only env fails naming HESTIA_ORIGIN, legacy proxies
  name is ignored, the owner CLI refuses the legacy origin name

